# Colorstorm Stallion's opus trigger, from Bot1's Mind Twist for X = 4 (five mana), is on the stack when Bot2 Bolts the Stallion (paying
# ward {1} with its Mox Ruby). The Stallion dies before the trigger resolves. The trigger still resolves (CR 608.2h, 113.7a): the +1/+1
# has nothing to apply to, but five mana was spent on the spell, so a token that's a copy of the Stallion as it last existed is created
# (CR 707.2). The Mind Twist then resolves: Bot2 discards 4. Bot1 ends with a 3/3 Stallion token and the original in the graveyard.

